  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AkRvhGp.png\" alt=\"鹽\" width=\"220\" height=\"220\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Salt 模組新增了食物加鹽機制，以及多種其他功能和方塊。</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7qubYox.png\" alt=\"加鹽\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GzyoTBf.png\" alt=\"獲取方式\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/088PZL6.png\" alt=\"其他功能\" width=\"1000\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支援食物加鹽的模組列表：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">農夫的豐饒 (Farmer's Delight)</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/miners-delight-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">礦工的喜悅 (Miner's Delight)</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/butchercraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">屠宰工藝 (Butchercraft)</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquaculture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquaculture 2</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Croptopia</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-depths-upgrade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Nether Depths Upgrade</strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他模組可透過 <strong>資料包 (datapack)</strong> 或 <strong>KubeJS</strong> 進行新增支援。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜歡這個模組嗎？&nbsp;您的支持將幫助我繼續開發此模組及其他作品！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"550\" height=\"108\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"108\" height=\"108\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&bull;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看我的其他模組：</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"Exposure\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"Envelope\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"Sooty Chimneys\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"Wares\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"Monobank\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"Thief\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"Chalk\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"Scholar\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"Horseman\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
